# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Customer data. Never commit any of this.
#
# These files hold names, mobile numbers, client IDs, declared values, charges
# and payment status for thousands of ChinaHub customers. A private repository
# is one mis-click away from being public, so the data stays off GitHub
# entirely rather than relying on the repo staying private.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls

# dashboard exports and app data bundles
bundle/
seed/
export*/
*-export*/

# anything the scripts write
out/
reports/

